  ('english', 'sentence-improvement', 'Improve the underlined part: If I was a pilot, I would fly across the world. (underlined: If I was)', 'No improvement', 'If I were', 'If I had been', 'If I am', 'B', 'Imaginary or hypothetical conditions take the subjunctive ''were'' for all persons.', 'Subjunctive mood', 'exam', '{}'),
