  ('english', 'fill-blanks', 'Fill in the blank: Safety is the ___ priority of every airline.', 'partial', 'parallel', 'paranoid', 'paramount', 'D', 'Paramount means of supreme importance.', 'Vocabulary in context', 'easy', '{}'),
