  ('reasoning', 'blood-relations', 'Pointing to a man, Riya said, "He is the son of my grandfather''s only son." How is the man related to Riya?', 'Uncle', 'Father', 'Brother', 'Cousin', 'C', 'Her grandfather''s only son is her father; her father''s son is her brother.', 'Blood relations', 'moderate', '{}'),
