  ('reasoning', 'ranking', 'In a row of 40 students, Anil is 12th from the left. What is his position from the right?', '28th', '30th', '27th', '29th', 'D', 'Position from right = 40 − 12 + 1 = 29.', 'Ranking', 'easy', '{}'),
  ('reasoning', 'seating-arrangement', 'P, Q, R, S and T sit in a row facing north. R sits at the extreme left end and S at the extreme right end. Q sits immediately to the right of P. T sits immediately to the left of S. Who sits in the middle?', 'Q', 'P', 'T', 'R', 'A', 'Positions: R(1), S(5), T(4). P and Q take 2 and 3 with Q to the right of P, so the order is R P Q T S.', 'Linear arrangement', 'exam', '{}'),
  ('reasoning', 'mathematical-operations', 'If ''+'' means ''×'', ''−'' means ''+'', ''×'' means ''÷'' and ''÷'' means ''−'', find the value of 8 + 3 − 12 × 4 ÷ 5.', '24', '22', '19', '26', 'B', 'The expression becomes 8 × 3 + 12 ÷ 4 − 5 = 24 + 3 − 5 = 22.', 'Symbol substitution', 'moderate', '{}'),
