  ('quant', 'geometry', 'The angles of a triangle are in the ratio 2 : 3 : 4. The largest angle is:', '90°', '80°', '100°', '60°', 'B', 'Sum = 9 parts = 180°, so one part = 20°; largest = 80°.', 'Angle sum property', 'easy', '{}'),
