  ('mathematics', 'probability', 'A bag has 3 red and 2 black balls. Two balls are drawn without replacement. The probability that both are red is:', '3/10', '9/25', '1/5', '3/5', 'A', '(3/5) × (2/4) = 3/10.', 'Conditional probability', 'moderate', '{}'),
