  ('management', 'scientific-management', 'Who is known as the father of Scientific Management?', 'Elton Mayo', 'Henri Fayol', 'Max Weber', 'F. W. Taylor', 'D', 'Frederick Winslow Taylor developed scientific management (time and motion study, differential piece rate).', 'Scientific management', 'easy', '{}'),
