  ('management', 'organizing', 'In delegation, which of the following cannot be delegated?', 'Work', 'Duties', 'Accountability', 'Authority', 'C', 'Authority is delegated, but the manager remains accountable for the result.', 'Delegation', 'exam', '{}'),
  ('management', 'organizing', '''Span of control'' refers to:', 'The duration of a manager''s tenure', 'The area of a manager''s authority', 'The number of levels in an organisation', 'The number of subordinates a manager can supervise effectively', 'D', 'Span of management is the number of subordinates reporting to one manager.', 'Span of control', 'moderate', '{}'),
  ('management', 'communication', '''Grapevine'' refers to:', 'Informal communication', 'Formal written communication', 'Mass communication', 'Downward communication', 'A', 'Grapevine is the informal network through which information spreads.', 'Informal communication', 'easy', '{}'),
