  ('management', 'promotion', 'Which of the following is NOT an element of the promotion mix?', 'Packaging', 'Personal selling', 'Advertising', 'Sales promotion', 'A', 'Promotion mix = advertising, personal selling, sales promotion and public relations. Packaging is part of product.', 'Promotion mix', 'easy', '{}'),
